v1\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.1\"><span class=\"content\">In your </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 John 1:9; [Ps. 31:1]</span></span><span class=\"content\">faithfulness answer me, in your </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 John 1:9; [Ps. 31:1]</span></span><span class=\"content\">righteousness!</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Job 14:3]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Enter not into judgment with your servant,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.2\"><span class=\"content\">for no one living is righteous </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 130:3; 1 Kgs. 8:46; Job 9:2; 15:14; 25:4; Eccles. 7:20; Rom. 3:23; 1 Cor. 4:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">before you.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">For the enemy has pursued my soul;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Ps. 88:3-6   </span></span><span class=\"content\">he has crushed my life to the ground;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Lam. 3:6\n        </span></span><span class=\"content\">he has made me sit in darkness like those long dead.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">Therefore my spirit </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 77:3</span></span><span class=\"content\">faints within me;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.4\"><span class=\"content\">my heart within me is appalled.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.4\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 77:5, 11   </span></span><span class=\"content\">I remember the days of old;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 77:12; 111:2  </span></span><span class=\"content\">I meditate on all that you have done;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.5\"><span class=\"content\">I ponder the work of your hands.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Job 11:13   </span></span><span class=\"content\">I stretch out my hands to you;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 42:2   </span></span><span class=\"content\">my soul thirsts for you like </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ps. 63:1]</span></span><span class=\"content\">a parched land. </span><span class=\"qs\"><span class=\"content\">Selah</span></span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 69:17; 102:2   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Answer me quickly, O </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">!</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Ps. 84:2]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">My spirit fails!</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 27:9   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Hide not your face from me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 28:1; 88:4  </span></span><span class=\"content\">lest I be like those who go down to the pit.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Ps. 90:14]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Let me hear in the morning of your steadfast love,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.8\"><span class=\"content\">for in you I </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 11:1; 25:2 </span></span><span class=\"content\">trust.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 25:4   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Make me know the way I should go,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 25:1\n        </span></span><span class=\"content\">for to you I lift up my soul.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 59:1; 142:6  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Deliver me from my enemies, O </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">!</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.9\"><span class=\"content\">I have fled to you for refuge.</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">143:9 </span><span class=\"ft\">One Hebrew manuscript, Septuagint; most Hebrew manuscripts </span><span class=\"fq\">To you I have covered</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Ps. 119:12]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Teach me to do your will,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.10\"><span class=\"content\">for you are my God!</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.10\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Neh. 9:20   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Let your good Spirit </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 23:3 </span></span><span class=\"content\">lead me</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.10\"><span class=\"content\">on </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 26:10; [Ps. 27:11]</span></span><span class=\"content\">level ground!</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.10\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 23:3; 25:11   </span></span><span class=\"content\">For your name&#8217;s sake, O </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 71:20 </span></span><span class=\"content\">preserve my life!</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.11\"><span class=\"content\">In your righteousness </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 142:7</span></span><span class=\"content\">bring my soul out of trouble!</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.11\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"content\">And in your steadfast love you will </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 54:5 </span></span><span class=\"content\">cut off my enemies,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.12\"><span class=\"content\">and you will destroy all the adversaries of my soul,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PSA.143.12\"><span class=\"content\">for I am your </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 116:16</span></span><span class=\"content\">servant.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["PSA.144"], "human": "Psalm 144", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["PSA.142"], "human": "Psalm 142", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["PSA.143"], "human": "Psalm 143", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "PSA.143.ESV", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \